abstract: "Research-oriented Python framework for auditable 2D incompressible periodic Navier-Stokes simulations, pseudo-spectral validation, controlled forcing diagnostics, and reproducible scientific evidence artifacts. This software is a computational research baseline and does not claim to solve the 3D Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize problem."
